@baseUrl = http://localhost:5229
@model = qwen3.5:9b

### Inspect tables and columns available to reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/schema

### Ask a sample business question
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "{{model}}",
  "question": "What was total completed sales by region?"
}

### Invalid model names are reported by Ollama as a gateway error
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "model-that-does-not-exist",
  "question": "Show completed sales by region"
}
